{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788379900895,"sessionID":"ses_f9c41a182ffeXV0U7B2A3hfjyw","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_2e1b61e953f040a5a3485f73","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"grep -rn \"trait\\|colon-only\\|prelude impl\" research-log/ | head -30"},"output":"research-log/named-functions-kept-an-open-question-open.md:59:the maintainer ratified the add-trait reading, so `[1, 2] + [3]` concatenates now. `concat`\nresearch-log/winnow-replaced-the-tokenizer-not-the-grammar.md:41:The library's own `ParserError` trait was implemented directly for this crate's existing `Error`\n","metadata":{"output":"research-log/named-functions-kept-an-open-question-open.md:59:the maintainer ratified the add-trait reading, so `[1, 2] + [3]` concatenates now. `concat`\nresearch-log/winnow-replaced-the-tokenizer-not-the-grammar.md:41:The library's own `ParserError` trait was implemented directly for this crate's existing `Error`\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"grep -rn \"trait\\|colon-only\\|prelude impl\" research-log/ | head -30","time":{"start":1788379900890,"end":1788379900892}},"id":"prt_063bfabd2001Ki3rvp4eYXrjUL","sessionID":"ses_f9c41a182ffeXV0U7B2A3hfjyw","messageID":"msg_063bfa0930013192A6rIUi2jeZ"}}
